1. Dashboard title and description
Title: Marketing Campaign Analysis Dashboard

Subtitle: Sales Performance Analysis Across Markets, Promotions and Locations

Description:
This dashboard provides an overview of marketing campaign sales performance. It analyses sales by market size, promotion, week, location and store age to identify important sales patterns and support data-driven decisions.
2. KPI cards
Add these KPI cards at the top of your dashboard.
TOTAL SALES
29.30K


TOTAL MARKETS
10


TOTAL LOCATIONS
137


TOTAL RECORDS
548



Note: Total sales are in thousands, as represented by the dataset's SalesInThousands column.
3. Charts to include
Chart title	Visualization	Fields
Sales by Market Size	Donut chart	MarketSize, Sum of SalesInThousands
Sales by Promotion	Bar chart	Promotion, Sum of SalesInThousands
Weekly Sales Trend	Line chart	week, Sum of SalesInThousands
Top 10 Locations	Horizontal bar chart	LocationID, Sum of SalesInThousands
Average Sales by Store Age	Column chart	AgeOfStore, Average of SalesInThousands
Sales by Store Age and Market Size	Stacked column chart	AgeOfStore, MarketSize, Average SalesInThousands

4. Sales by market size
Use this information in your dashboard:
Market size	Sales	Contribution
Medium	14.08K	48.0%
Large  	11.78K	40.2%
Small	  3.44K	11.76%

Insight: Medium-sized markets contribute the highest share of total sales, followed by large and small markets.
5. Promotion analysis
Promotion	Approximate dashboard sales
Promotion 1	10.0K
Promotion 2	8.9K
Promotion 3	10.4K

Insight: Promotion 3 records the highest sales, while Promotion 2 records the lowest sales.
6. Weekly sales trend
Week	Approximate dashboard sales
Week 1	7.38K
Week 2	7.31K
Week 3	7.32K
Week 4	7.29K

Insight: Sales remain relatively stable across all four weeks, with Week 1 recording the highest sales.
7. Add slicers for interactivity
Add these slicers on the left or top of your dashboard:
- Market Size
- Promotion
- Week
- Location ID
- Store Age
These will allow users to filter the dashboard and explore different sales categories.
8. Add a key insights panel
You can place this text in a separate text box on your dashboard:
KEY BUSINESS INSIGHTS
- Medium markets contribute approximately 48% of total sales.
- Promotion 3 records the highest promotion-wise sales.
- Week 1 has the highest weekly sales.
- The dataset covers 137 locations across 10 markets.
- Location-wise analysis helps identify high-performing locations.
- Store-age analysis helps compare sales performance across different store ages.
